.SH NAME
ssoossh-ssh-inspect - Print details of the currently held ssoossh certificate(s).


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBssoossh ssh inspect [flags] [args]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows what each certificate ssoossh is holding actually grants — who it is for, when it expires, and which extensions and critical options it carries — rather than the certificate blob, which tells a human nothing.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for inspect


